---
import BlogLayout from "../layouts/BlogLayout.astro";
import { URLS } from "../constants";
---

<BlogLayout title="Music">
  <h1>Projects</h1>

  <section>
    <h2>Mel and the Dragon</h2>
    <p>
      This project started after I abandoned{" "}
      <a href={URLS.tronicDisease} target="_blank">tronicDisease</a> in search of
      a new sound. A lot of the tracks came to me during the 2020 lockdown. By
      this time I was a full time software engineer and only able to work on
      music when I had downtime. As of 2026 this project is still going at a
      steady pace of 1 release per year. It's not much but it's honest work. The
      sound is a mix of hip hop, r&b and maybe a sprinkle of rock, also UK drill
      which I'm a sucker for.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="tronicDisease">
    <h2>tronicDisease</h2>
    <p>
      This project contains the first set of tracks that I ever released on the
      internet. As the name suggests, it has a very electronic sound to it that
      comes from a mish mash of whatever inspired me at the time. It's kind of a
      time capsule because I don't think I'll be able to recreate that same sound
      again. Sometimes I listen back to this and wonder what the hell I was on
      when I came up with these tracks.
    </p>
  </section>
</BlogLayout>
